{
 "duration": 99.142,
 "segments": [
  {
   "para": 0,
   "text": "This is Mike.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 1.258
  },
  {
   "para": 0,
   "text": "Mike sat down to answer one email.",
   "start": 1.578,
   "end": 3.554
  },
  {
   "para": 0,
   "text": "Three hours later\u2026",
   "start": 3.874,
   "end": 5.006
  },
  {
   "para": 0,
   "text": "he's alphabetizing his spice rack.",
   "start": 5.556,
   "end": 7.483
  },
  {
   "para": 0,
   "text": "And he still hasn't answered the email.",
   "start": 7.803,
   "end": 9.745
  },
  {
   "para": 0,
   "text": "Sound familiar?",
   "start": 10.065,
   "end": 11.018
  },
  {
   "para": 0,
   "text": "Let's look inside Mike's brain.",
   "start": 11.338,
   "end": 13.14
  },
  {
   "para": 1,
   "text": "Picture Mike's mind as a control room.",
   "start": 13.91,
   "end": 16.135
  },
  {
   "para": 1,
   "text": "In most brains, there's a manager deciding what's important.",
   "start": 16.455,
   "end": 19.973
  },
  {
   "para": 1,
   "text": "In an ADHD brain, that manager is\u2026",
   "start": 20.293,
   "end": 23.309
  },
  {
   "para": 1,
   "text": "kind of on vacation.",
   "start": 23.859,
   "end": 25.057
  },
  {
   "para": 1,
   "text": "ADHD affects focus, planning, and impulse control.",
   "start": 25.377,
   "end": 29.188
  },
  {
   "para": 1,
   "text": "It's linked to how the brain handles dopamine, the chemical that says \"this is worth doing.\"",
   "start": 29.508,
   "end": 34.48
  },
  {
   "para": 1,
   "text": "Boring task?",
   "start": 34.8,
   "end": 35.76
  },
  {
   "para": 1,
   "text": "Very little dopamine.",
   "start": 36.08,
   "end": 37.428
  },
  {
   "para": 1,
   "text": "So the brain goes looking for something more exciting.",
   "start": 37.748,
   "end": 40.286
  },
  {
   "para": 2,
   "text": "That's why Mike loses track of time.",
   "start": 41.056,
   "end": 42.986
  },
  {
   "para": 2,
   "text": "\"Five minutes\" becomes an hour.",
   "start": 43.306,
   "end": 44.869
  },
  {
   "para": 2,
   "text": "He walks into a room and forgets why.",
   "start": 45.189,
   "end": 47.268
  },
  {
   "para": 2,
   "text": "He knows the bill is due\u2026",
   "start": 47.588,
   "end": 48.92
  },
  {
   "para": 2,
   "text": "he just can't make himself start.",
   "start": 49.47,
   "end": 51.083
  },
  {
   "para": 2,
   "text": "It's not laziness.",
   "start": 51.403,
   "end": 52.513
  },
  {
   "para": 2,
   "text": "His brain is simply wired differently.",
   "start": 52.833,
   "end": 54.857
  },
  {
   "para": 3,
   "text": "And feelings?",
   "start": 55.627,
   "end": 56.504
  },
  {
   "para": 3,
   "text": "They hit harder.",
   "start": 56.824,
   "end": 57.77
  },
  {
   "para": 3,
   "text": "A small criticism can feel like a punch.",
   "start": 58.09,
   "end": 60.479
  },
  {
   "para": 3,
   "text": "Frustration shows up fast.",
   "start": 60.799,
   "end": 62.456
  },
  {
   "para": 3,
   "text": "Many people with ADHD say this is the hardest part, and the least talked about.",
   "start": 62.776,
   "end": 67.909
  },
  {
   "para": 4,
   "text": "But here's the twist.",
   "start": 68.679,
   "end": 69.871
  },
  {
   "para": 4,
   "text": "When something grabs Mike's interest, he locks in.",
   "start": 70.191,
   "end": 72.947
  },
  {
   "para": 4,
   "text": "It's called hyperfocus.",
   "start": 73.267,
   "end": 74.729
  },
  {
   "para": 4,
   "text": "Hours fly by.",
   "start": 75.049,
   "end": 76.156
  },
  {
   "para": 4,
   "text": "Lots of people with ADHD are creative, energetic, and great at thinking on their feet.",
   "start": 76.476,
   "end": 82.307
  },
  {
   "para": 5,
   "text": "So the lesson?",
   "start": 83.077,
   "end": 83.92
  },
  {
   "para": 5,
   "text": "An ADHD brain isn't broken.",
   "start": 84.24,
   "end": 86.417
  },
  {
   "para": 5,
   "text": "It's different.",
   "start": 86.737,
   "end": 87.582
  },
  {
   "para": 5,
   "text": "Small steps, timers, and the right support can change everything.",
   "start": 87.902,
   "end": 91.828
  },
  {
   "para": 5,
   "text": "And if this sounds like you, talk to a doctor.",
   "start": 92.148,
   "end": 94.562
  },
  {
   "para": 6,
   "text": "See you next time.",
   "start": 95.332,
   "end": 96.367
  },
  {
   "para": 6,
   "text": "Stay mojo.",
   "start": 96.687,
   "end": 97.572
  }
 ]
}